body:
method Request::loadCookies load cookies for CookieCollection. CookieCollection contains

```
object(yii\web\Cookie)[54]
          public 'name' => string 'lang' (length=4)
          public 'value' => string 'ru' (length=2)
          public 'domain' => string '' (length=0)
          public 'expire' => int 0
          public 'path' => string '/' (length=1)
          public 'secure' => boolean false
          public 'httpOnly' => boolean false
```

attribute "expire" by default always 0, and if call `CookieCollection::has('lang')` return false because method `CookieCollection::has`  checks `expire >= time()`

```
public function has($name)
    {
        return isset($this->_cookies[$name]) && $this->_cookies[$name]->value !== ''
            && ($this->_cookies[$name]->expire === null || $this->_cookies[$name]->expire >= time());
    }
```
